hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"154","Ahmad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Wahb told me, my uncle told me, Amr, who is Ibn al-Harith, told me that Hibban bin Wasi’ told him, that his father He told him that he heard Abdullah bin Zaid bin Asim Al-Mazni mentioning that he saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “performing ablution.” So he rinsed his mouth, then rinsed his mouth, then washed his face three times, his right hand three times, and the other three times, and wiped his head with water other than the rest of his hand, and washed his feet until he cleaned them.”"
